---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
interface Props { locale: Locale; active?: 'legacy' | 'ceiling' | 'openevo2' | 'index' }
const { locale, active = 'index' } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn:string,en:string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path:string) => localePath(locale,path);
---
<section class="s2-choice" data-testid="stage2-strategy-selector" aria-labelledby="s2-choice-title">
  <div class="s2-choice__head">
    <p>{t('Stage 2 的三次尝试', 'THREE STAGE-2 DESIGNS')}</p>
    <h2 id="s2-choice-title">{t('我们连续修了两个不同问题：先是“成功经验进不了训练”，后来是“历史经验把动作接口带偏”', 'We encountered two different problems in sequence: successful experience was first blocked from training, then historical experience began disrupting the action interface')}</h2>
    <span>{t('第一版把每 256 次任务单独设门槛，导致有成功经验也不更新；第二版 Ceiling-1.0 删掉这道门。在当时用于分叉判断的运行快照里，7B 能继续学习，而 3B 完成 18 轮仍没有新参数组件，并出现大量“当前页面不存在这个动作”的失败；后续 OpenEVO 2.0 从这里另开 harness 研究线。', 'The first design judged every 256 attempts separately, so successful experience could still fail to reach training. Ceiling-1.0 removed that gate. In the historical run snapshot used to motivate the fork, 7B continued learning while 3B completed 18 rounds with zero new parameter components and many actions unavailable on the live page; OpenEVO 2.0 later forked from this snapshot into a separate harness study.')}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="s2-choice__shared" aria-label={t('Ceiling-1.0 与 Harness 2.0 共用同一份 Stage 1 数据','Ceiling-1.0 and Harness 2.0 reuse the same Stage-1 data')}>
    <div><span>{t('共同数据','SHARED DATA')}</span><strong>{t('Stage 1 已经完成','Stage 1 is already complete')}</strong><small>{t('每个模型 1,440 次学生任务 + 1,440 条老师分析','1,440 student attempts + 1,440 teacher analyses per model')}</small></div>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 90 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="s2-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" /></marker></defs><path d="M2 12 H84" /></svg>
    <div><span>{t('从这里开始不同','REDESIGN STARTS HERE')}</span><strong>{t('经验怎样整理并进入下一步','How experience is organized and delivered')}</strong><small>{t('Ceiling-1.0 与 Harness 2.0 在这里分开','Ceiling-1.0 and Harness 2.0 diverge here')}</small></div>
  </div>

  <div class="s2-choice__grid">
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','legacy',{active:active==='legacy'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-256-window/')} aria-current={active==='legacy'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>01 · {t('第一版 · 已取代','FIRST DESIGN · SUPERSEDED')}</span><b>{t('有成功经验，但每 256 次重新过门槛，最后一次都没学', 'Successful experience existed, but every 256 attempts re-applied a gate and no update ever happened')}</b></div>
      <p>{t('每 256 次任务是一批；同一批必须有 8 个不同任务各自成功 2 次才允许更新。不同批之间不能累计成功，所以 7B/self 即使最终有 797 条可训练成功轨迹，Stage 2 仍是 0 次参数更新。', 'Every 256 attempts formed one batch, and at least eight distinct tasks each had to succeed twice before parameters could update. Success could not carry across batches, so even 797 trainable exact-success traces in 7B/self still resulted in zero Stage-2 updates.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看第一版为什么设计错 →','Open why the first design failed →')}</strong>
    </a>
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','ceiling',{active:active==='ceiling'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/')} aria-current={active==='ceiling'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>02 · {t('第二版 · 3B 问题暴露','SECOND DESIGN · 3B PROBLEM EXPOSED')}</span><b>OpenEVO-Ceiling-1.0</b></div>
      <p>{t('旧门槛删掉后，每 128 次任务形成一轮证据。当时的诊断快照记录：7B 继续产生参数更新，3B 完成 18 轮时仍是 0 个新参数组件，并频繁选择当前页面不存在的动作。18 轮是这个历史快照，不是当前 3B live 状态。','After removing the old gate, every 128 attempts form one evidence round. The historical diagnostic snapshot recorded continued 7B parameter updates and zero new 3B parameter components after 18 completed rounds, with frequent actions unavailable on the current page. The 18-round figure is that snapshot, not current live 3B state.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看第二版为什么 3B 仍然不行 →','Open why 3B still failed in the second design →')}</strong>
    </a>
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','openevo2',{active:active==='openevo2'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/')} aria-current={active==='openevo2'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>03 · {t('第三版 · 2.0.1 机械资格已完成','THIRD DESIGN · 2.0.1 MECHANICAL QUALIFICATION COMPLETE')}</span><b>OpenEVO 2.0</b></div>
      <p>{t('Stage 1 不重做。第一次 Harness 2.0 的 128+128 配对检查原样保留；后续 Harness 2.0.1 mechanical qualification 已 PASS。当前 scientific closeout 仍是 HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT，formal_stage2_authorized=false、final_panel_access_authorized=false；下一阶段是 Stage2 readiness audit 与 dress rehearsal。','Stage 1 is reused. The first paired 128+128 Harness 2.0 study remains unchanged, and the later Harness 2.0.1 mechanical qualification is PASS. Scientific closeout remains HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT with formal_stage2_authorized=false and final_panel_access_authorized=false; the next phase is the Stage2 readiness audit and dress rehearsal.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看 OpenEVO 2.0 与 Harness 2.0 迷你实验 →','Open OpenEVO 2.0 and the Harness 2.0 mini study →')}</strong>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.s2-choice{margin:1rem 0 1.4rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:18px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 1.5%,transparent)}
.s2-choice__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,.45fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:.65rem 1.2rem;padding:.15rem .15rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.s2-choice__head>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .62rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.s2-choice__head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);letter-spacing:-.035em}.s2-choice__head>span{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.65}
.s2-choice__shared{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 90px minmax(0,1fr);gap:.65rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem;padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:11px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 3%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__shared>div{min-width:0}.s2-choice__shared span,.s2-choice__shared strong,.s2-choice__shared small{display:block}.s2-choice__shared span{color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .54rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em}.s2-choice__shared strong{margin:.24rem 0;font-size:.78rem}.s2-choice__shared small{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.64rem}.s2-choice__shared svg{width:100%;height:24px}.s2-choice__shared svg path{fill:none;stroke:var(--color-accent);stroke-width:1.7;marker-end:url(#s2-arrow)}.s2-choice__shared svg marker path{fill:var(--color-accent);stroke:none}
.s2-choice__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;margin-top:1rem}.s2-choice__card{display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:13px;color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:none;background:var(--color-bg);transition:border-color .15s ease,transform .15s ease}.s2-choice__card:hover,.s2-choice__card.active{border-color:var(--color-accent);transform:translateY(-1px)}.s2-choice__card div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.25rem}.s2-choice__card span{font:800 .58rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.s2-choice__card b{font-size:1rem}.s2-choice__card p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.62}.s2-choice__card>strong{margin-top:auto;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.71rem}.s2-choice__card.legacy{border-style:dashed}.s2-choice__card.legacy.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-warning) 5%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__card.ceiling.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 5%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{border-width:2px}.s2-choice__card.openevo2.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 7%,var(--color-bg))}
@media(max-width:900px){.s2-choice__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{grid-column:1/-1}}
@media(max-width:760px){.s2-choice__head,.s2-choice__grid,.s2-choice__shared{grid-template-columns:1fr}.s2-choice__head>p{grid-column:auto}.s2-choice__shared svg{width:30px;transform:rotate(90deg);justify-self:center}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
